<title>PORTUGAL: C.Amorim Jan-Sept pre-tax profit up 9.2 pct.</title>
<headline>C.Amorim Jan-Sept pre-tax profit up 9.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
